## Citation
If you use DDoSimu5G in your research, please cite our work:

```bibtex
@inproceedings{khalil2026ddosimu5g,
  title={DDoSimu5G: A DDoS Attack Simulation Framework for 5G Networks},
  author={Khalil, Karim and Gehrmann, Christian and Ramezanian, Sara and Sternby, Jakob},
  booktitle={Proceedings of the ACM SIGSIM Conference on Principles of Advanced Discrete Simulation (PADS)},
  year={2026},
  publisher={ACM},
  doi={[to be added after publication]}
}
```

## Acknowledgments
This project builds upon:
- [OMNeT++](https://omnetpp.org/) discrete event simulator
- [INET Framework](https://inet.omnetpp.org/)
- [Simu5G](http://simu5g.org/) - 5G NR and LTE/LTE-A user-plane simulation model
- [The ONE Simulator](https://akeranen.github.io/the-one/) for mobility trace generation
